{
  "Npcs.Marble.Desc": "Before you stands a female humanoid with numerous cow features, such as medium-sized cow horns, cow ears, and a cow tail. She is very well endowed, with wide hips and a wide ass. She stands over 6 feet tall. She is using a large two handed hammer with practiced ease, making it clear she is much stronger than she may appear to be."
  "Npcs.Marble.Name": "Marble"
}
